  <static seed="98" source="Contrib/DMOI/1-Counting/1_2-Binomial_Coefficients/1_2_6.pg">
    <statement><p>How many 13-bit strings contain 4 or more 1<rsq/>s?</p>
<p><fillin characters="5" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>7814</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p>Count the number of strings with each permissible number of 1<rsq/>s separately and then add them up.  So there are <m>{13 \choose 4} + {13 \choose 5} + \cdots {13 \choose 13} = {7814}</m> strings.</p>
</solution>
